<div class="sa-split sa-row"><div class="sa-copy"><h2>Kitchen Design Solutions for Covington Homes</h2><p>Homes in Covington range from traditional layouts to newer open-concept designs, and each presents its own opportunities and constraints. Our kitchen designs respect the character of the home while improving usability and flow.</p><p>Popular kitchen design features we create for Covington clients include:</p><ul class="sa-list"><li>Islands designed for prep, seating, and gathering</li><li>Cabinet layouts that maximize storage without overwhelming the space</li><li>Durable countertop materials suited for daily use</li><li>Lighting plans that balance task lighting and warmth</li><li>Seamless connections between kitchen, dining, and living areas</li></ul><p>Every design is customized to the homeowner, not pulled from a template.</p></div><figure class="sa-media sa-photo"><img alt="Gray kitchen island with white bar stools under gold lantern pendants" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" src="/images/2024/11/06mls.webp" width="1200"></figure></div>
